<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="no"?>
<resources>
    <string name="example_explain">This example provides code samples for iFLYTEK Voice Android platform developers, including voice dictation, grammar recognition, semantic understanding, and speech synthesis, aiming to enable users to quickly develop applications based on the voice interface.</string>
    <string name="text_tts_source">
        As an intelligent voice technology provider, iFLYTEK has long-term research accumulation in the field of intelligent voice technology, and has achieved technical accomplishments in Chinese speech synthesis, speech recognition, spoken language evaluation, and many other technologies. iFLYTEK is China\'s "National 863 Program Industrialization Base" oriented towards voice technology industrialization.....
    </string>
    <string name="text_tts_source_en">iFLYTEK is a national key software enterprise dedicated to the research of intelligent speech and language technologies, development of software and chip products, provision of speech information services, and integration of E-government systems. The intelligent speech technology of iFLYTEK, the core technology of the company, represents the top level in the world.</string>
    <string name="text_isr_abnf_hint">\tUpload content:\n\t#ABNF 1.0 gb2312;\n\tlanguage zh-CN;\n\tmode voice;\n\troot $main;\n\t$main = $place1 to $place2 ;\n\t$place1 = Beijing | Wuhan | Nanjing | Tianjin | Tokyo;\n\t$place2 = Shanghai | Hefei;</string>
    <string name="text_understand_hint">\tYou can say:\n\tWhat\'s the weather like today?\n\tTrains from Beijing to Shanghai?\n\tPlay a song?\n\n\tFor more semantic options, visit:\n\thttp://aiui.xfyun.cn/ \n\tConfigure your custom semantics!</string>
